/// Secondary 3 (Year 9) Computing -- Term 6: "Web Development and
/// APIs". Introduces client-server architecture and the request-
/// response cycle (Week 21), extends into APIs and the JSON data
/// format used to exchange data between programs (Week 22), then
/// builds a real Flask web server with routes and HTML templates
/// (Week 23), closing with a capstone week (Week 24, a boss week) that
/// chains all three together into a live weather web app: a Flask
/// route function that itself acts as an API client, fetching JSON
/// from an external weather API and rendering it into a template for
/// the browser, with graceful failure handling if the API is down.
