        passageEn:
            "For a class project, Nay Chi writes a \"Technology Diary\" listing every piece of technology she uses in one day and how it helps her.\n\nIn the morning, her family's refrigerator keeps the milk cold for her breakfast, and the rice cooker cooks rice perfectly for lunch later.\n\nAfter school, she uses a video call app to talk to her cousin who lives in another city, seeing her cousin's face on the screen even though they are far apart.\n\nThat night, the streetlights outside help her family walk home safely in the dark, and Nay Chi realizes that technology helps her in dozens of small ways every single day, from keeping food fresh to helping people stay connected and safe.",
