        passageEn:
            "During an online class game, Moe Moe notices that Htet Htet made a small mistake and lost points for their team.\n\nSome classmates start typing unkind comments in the chat, but Moe Moe decides to write something different: \"It's okay, everyone makes mistakes! Let's try again together.\"\n\nHtet Htet feels much better after reading Moe Moe's message, and the team goes on to finish the game with everyone encouraging each other.\n\nTheir teacher later tells the whole class that being kind online -- just like being kind in person -- makes everyone feel safer and happier, and that Moe Moe's kind message was a perfect example of good online behavior.",
