    DailyLessonDef(
      id: "course-y2-computing-w27-d4",
      dayNumber: 4,
      titleEn: "A Kind Word for Zaw Zaw",
      titleMy: "ဇော်ဇော်အတွက် ကြင်နာသောစကားလုံး",
      kind: LessonKind.reading,
      xpReward: 10,
      readingPassage: ReadingPassageModel(
        titleEn: "A Kind Word for Zaw Zaw",
        titleMy: "ဇော်ဇော်အတွက် ကြင်နာသောစကားလုံး",
        passageEn:
            "Zaw Zaw had worked hard all week on a drawing of a peacock for the class's online art gallery, a website where students could share their artwork and read comments from classmates. On Friday, his teacher uploaded the drawing, and Zaw Zaw felt very proud when he saw it on the screen for the first time.\n\n"
            "A little later, Zaw Zaw checked the gallery again and saw a comment from a classmate that said, 'This drawing is ugly, you can't even draw properly.' Zaw Zaw's face fell, and he felt his eyes sting with tears. He quietly closed the laptop and sat with his head down, not wanting to look at his drawing anymore.\n\n"
            "Nay Chi noticed that Zaw Zaw seemed upset and asked what was wrong. When he showed her the unkind comment, Nay Chi and Moe Moe were quick to act. 'That comment isn't fair, and it isn't true,' said Moe Moe. 'Let's show this to our teacher, and let's also leave you some kind comments to remind you how much we like your drawing.' The two friends typed encouraging comments under Zaw Zaw's peacock drawing, and Nay Chi reported the unkind comment to their teacher.\n\n"
            "The teacher removed the unkind comment and gently reminded the whole class that everyone should be as kind and respectful online as they would be in person. She said that behind every comment is a real person with real feelings. Zaw Zaw smiled again when he read Moe Moe and Nay Chi's kind words, and from then on, the three friends made sure to always leave encouraging comments for their classmates.",
        passageMy:
            "ဇော်ဇော်သည် အတန်း၏ အွန်လိုင်း အနုပညာပြခန်း (ကျောင်းသားများ မိမိတို့၏ ပန်းချီကားများကို မျှဝေနိုင်ပြီး အတန်းဖော်များ၏ မှတ်ချက်များကို ဖတ်နိုင်သည့် ဝဘ်ဆိုက်တစ်ခု) အတွက် ဒေါင်းငှက်ပုံတစ်ပုံကို တစ်ပတ်လုံး ကြိုးစား၍ ရေးဆွဲခဲ့သည်။ သောကြာနေ့တွင် ဆရာမက ပုံကို upload တင်ခဲ့ရာ ဇော်ဇော်သည် ၎င်း၏ပုံကို ဖန်သားပြင်ပေါ်တွင် ပထမဆုံးအကြိမ် မြင်ရသောအခါ အလွန်ဂုဏ်ယူခဲ့သည်။\n\n"
